  "description": "Deterministic lockstep engine for SetNet: the server collects each participant's input for a turn and, once all are in (or the turn times out), broadcasts the complete input set so every client advances identically. Ideal for RTS and deterministic games. server.UseLockstep() / client.UseLockstep(). Depends only on SetNet.",
